        "bullet_point": [
          {
            "value": "Perfect Design and Color Coordination: Carefully selected trio of colorful artificial succulents paired with the marble-patterned ceramic flower pot creates a perfect artistic decoration, Their lifelike appearance brings a touch of greenery and freshness to your home or office space, infusing it with boundless vitality",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          },
          {
            "value": "Perpetually Maintains Freshness: Flower pot of this artificial plant is made of ceramic material, while the succulent plants are crafted from safe PE material, faux succulents within the pot can maintain their freshness over extended periods, no unpleasant odors associated, poses no health risks to humans or pets,ensuring safety and reliability",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          },
          {
            "value": "Versatile for Various Scenarios: Faux succulent planter is exceptionally well-suited for various settings, such as your office desk, living room, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, modern home office, dining area, coffee table, side table, wall shelves, bookshelves, study desk or TV area, serving as the perfect decoration, equally fitting to place on bedside tables, window sills or mantelpieces, can be used individually or in multiple combinations for added impact",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          }
        ],
        "product_description": [
          {
            "value": "Bring a touch of nature indoors with our delightful collection of tiny succulent plants. These miniature succulents are perfect for adding a touch of greenery to your home, office, or any small space. Each plant is carefully selected and grown to ensure vibrant color and unique texture. Ideal for beginners, these low-maintenance plants require minimal care and are perfect for creating a stunning miniature garden or terrarium. Enjoy the beauty of nature without the hassle!",
            "language_tag": "en_US",
            "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
          }
